---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
// Adjust this path if your CSS file is located elsewhere
import '../styles/InfoPages.css'; 
---

<Layout 
  title="Contact Us" 
  description="Get in touch with Neohexane. Send us your questions, report bugs, or collaborate on chemistry articles and interactive tools."
>
  <div class="neo-page-container">
    <div class="neo-page-content">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
      
      <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
      <p>Whether you have a question about a specific chemical element, found a bug in the Interactive Pages, or want to discuss a business/collaboration opportunity, I would love to hear from you!</p>
      
      <h3>Direct Contact</h3>
      <p>The fastest way to reach me is via email. I personally read every message and strive to respond within 24 to 48 hours.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:qwertyritin@gmail.com">qwertyritin@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li>Location: Jamshedpur, Jharkhand, India</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3>Contribute & Collaborate</h3>
      <p>Are you a chemistry student, educator, or science enthusiast with a great idea? We are always looking to feature passionate voices on Neohexane! Whether you want to publish an article, share a unique study guide, or propose a new interactive feature, you are welcome here. Send a brief pitch or draft to my email with the subject line "Guest Contribution," and let's build something awesome together.</p>
      
      <h3>Connect on Socials</h3>
      <p>You can also find Neohexane where it all started! Send a DM, check out our latest chemistry posts, or just say hi.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Instagram: <a href="https://instagram.com/neohexane" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@neohexane</a></li>
      </ul>
      
      <p>(Note: If you are reporting a technical issue with the interactive models, please include your browser name and device type so I can fix it as quickly as possible!)</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
